2026-08-25T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2026) 'See `DETAILS.md` for the full argument.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2026  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2026) 'See `DETAILS.md` for the full argument.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2026  1 LINE
